sequenceDiagram
accTitle: TLS selection precedes application routing
accDescr: The client supplies a hostname in TLS SNI. The ALB selects its certificate, completes TLS, then evaluates the HTTP host to choose a target group.
participant C as Browser
participant A as ALB listener
participant T as Target group
C->>A: TLS ClientHello, SNI app.example.net
A->>A: Select matching certificate from list
A-->>C: Certificate for app.example.net
Note over C,A: TLS handshake completes
C->>A: Encrypted HTTP request, Host app.example.net
A->>A: Evaluate host-based routing rule
A->>T: Forward request
T-->>A: Application response
A-->>C: Encrypted response
